Project: CoachIQ, a React/Prisma/PostgreSQL web app for running coaches
Tech Stack: React, Prisma, PostgreSQL, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript
Default Scope: src/components/, src/lib/, schema.prisma, package.json
Styling: Use Tailwind CSS for all components
Restrictions:
- Never modify schema.prisma or database migrations unless explicitly instructed
- Do not edit node_modules/, .env, or config files without approval
- Avoid generating console.logs in production code
- Follow React best practices (e.g., hooks, no prop drilling)
Conventions:
- File names: camelCase for components (e.g., trainingPlan.tsx)
- Prisma: Use explicit relations and indexes in schema.prisma
- Commit changes with descriptive messages (e.g., "Add dialog cancel button")